      "message": "Kai, thanks for the review! I followed your advice and changed the code. \nQC also gave some advice that we should limit the workaround with existing devices, as their next release of device will fix this issue. So I introduced the concept of GPU generation, which hopes to ease the overall workaround mechanism. \nPlease review again!",
